  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c417b694066e4da275ca3f0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然风风是大坏蛋，\r\n但觉得偶尔出手跟伙伴\r\n同心协力也不错喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9373c0257931c4db0b7610698e2e0c781cfde743a919aa1415e4b5438ff22313",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c47f7cd460fc16f1f874c34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘻嘻嘻……唔？哇哈哈！那家伙！\r\n这家伙！全都赢不过风风喔──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "721b742a25f5bc8a3baa3dab1d789e5759bc5e9083e132f9642bea7362e7c22f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2185801550cfa3001b7d0071",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动任务？\r\n风风搞不太懂，\r\n就派你去看看是怎么回事吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "44d47ac83a9686f03fd45883c6073738de31e89ccf6f48e66572c726ed0dc0f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:267e70387070aa17b325997e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没忘记东西吧？\r\n能拿的东西就要全都拿走！\r\n这就是坏蛋的规矩喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8b0ed0da609cd3d8aea9157be7fc057ef87b64e1626733159dbf0345ceb3562",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11c06736cd59e8986015370c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紧紧咬着，走着瞧吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6dfe53d67c3aae311dcec55e9aa5b2300fa610718f34d39de8a45923410f76b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc03e778d837dc86f41d6ed7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "会发光的那个！要用力挥喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2beede85a88a79f22357bdeaa316ea03ed5066b5c4626b9fbf2202746e8ab93d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1afc0cf44d2f5b5ed3038e7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吼──！不理我我就咬人喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a62012cf54dfab8c8187cc4f0d3a6069b8c705c533a82b15679ac64e73ea9db6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbb4905b8621c50ce2419862",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是风风好心才选了\r\n你这软弱的家伙！\r\n还不感谢风风！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2695be1e1fd5943b1dbfbd6de18389cd56f178f90518de5519a0efc55bbb217f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61204134042b08c1cd1fa544",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘻嘻嘻，今天要对谁恶作剧呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3da4206ed729021482976fc828ab05cdf420f32fdc51b43b181fc3162a1a31a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4f72ce796ba80961f5c8204",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谁敢说风风「可爱」……嘎吼吼吼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0367fe7fead4de97d9eb3c38c39c8da6f0888282530224b64b1ff81919214aa9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad6537403b4645ac590efd00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "狂野地「吼──」！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9b37c48bda8df76c736b7478ff39005f69dda40c042d23f31c385c385534b1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05c09b245f3eb0c13c914a6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "菱亚烫衣服的技巧超专业喔……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3d5d32973063a7025b65b0993d2d143646ff5fd12d18d9efc15acd28f92660b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0e88cec5134481d941a2a39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这闪亮亮的钮扣品味真赞！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2489ded5ac03a366bb0eed4d85d171af9fd9ce2a182a3f772a0eead351b6ed9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57dcb0cca48c692e1c081274",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好多利牙，超帅的喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a45c6fb6807136fb2e42ee36c8c4ade7f5eed9f6ca00e79ceb1abca48b44f31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddce5de131d1b32fd948ad34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风风喜欢最引人注目的衣服喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ad54c8ce974d3579b4d98c84be46c4661fb89b29316bb7f1c1daf752adbbfd0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4987cd1fee0b7f91e05abd36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好吧～这套也不错呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a9044229acee347f982387e136a7e297246331b91c2af6d7fb6beb0e82b847d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:152b2e2522803e5808fd85ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あーそーべー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "96fefd5e9ba250eda32dbebbb14c92583df2b7b103a546788c8cc69e0255fa5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b1fa75ec6ce52a1a549b39e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この『ガブちゃん』、イカすのだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f458cae765d5e5db758fd1b53cae6a8fbb451fc6991b2169a75a3eb015d8bd14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfd08c05a888865261f05c46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘻嘻嘻，今天要对谁恶作剧呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3da4206ed729021482976fc828ab05cdf420f32fdc51b43b181fc3162a1a31a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
